Code Review User Manual
***********************

Code Review lets you review pull requests on Github and merge requests
on Gitlab without leaving Emacs: read the diff and the discussion, write
comments and replies, and approve or request changes.  Its buffers are
built with Magit's sections and its commands are gathered in a Transient
menu.

   This manual is for Code Review 0.0.7, an Emacs package for reviewing
Github pull requests and Gitlab merge requests.

