10 Saving and Resuming Reviews
******************************

Local comments live in a database, so a review can be left unfinished:

‘r C-c C-s’
     Save the review (‘code-review-save-unfinished-review’).

‘r C-c C-r’
     Choose a saved review and open it again
     (‘code-review-open-unfinished-review’).

‘M-x code-review-recover-unfinished-review’
     Open the saved review of the pull request at a URL.

   The database is ‘code-review-db-database-file’, by default
‘code-review-db-file.sqlite’ in ‘user-emacs-directory’.


