14.1 Authentication
===================

Code Review needs a Github token to fetch pull requests and submit
reviews for you.  With ‘code-review-auth-login-marker’ set to ‘forge’,
it uses Forge's token.  Otherwise:

  1. Create a personal access token on Github with the ‘repo’ scope.  On
     Github Enterprise, also give it the ‘read:discussion’ and
     ‘write:discussion’ scopes.
  2. Add a line with your login and the token to your auth source file,
     usually ‘~/.authinfo.gpg’:

          machine api.github.com login yourlogin^code-review password TOKEN


File: code-review.info,  Node: Github Enterprise,  Prev: Github Authentication,  Up: Github

14.2 Github Enterprise
======================

On Github Enterprise, the token must be in your auth source under each
host and path Code Review uses.  For example, for ‘ghe.example.com’:

     machine ghe.example.com             login yourlogin^code-review password TOKEN
     machine ghe.example.com/api         login yourlogin^code-review password TOKEN
     machine ghe.example.com/api/v3      login yourlogin^code-review password TOKEN
     machine ghe.example.com/api/graphql login yourlogin^code-review password TOKEN

   Then set the hosts.  ‘/graphql’ is appended to
‘code-review-github-graphql-host’ automatically.
‘code-review-github-base-url’ is only needed to start reviews from a URL
with ‘code-review-start’.

     (setq code-review-github-host "ghe.example.com/api/v3"
           code-review-github-graphql-host "ghe.example.com/api"
           code-review-github-base-url "ghe.example.com")

   Code Review also needs to know your username on the instance:

     git config --global github.ghe.example.com.user yourlogin
     git config --global github.ghe.example.com/api.user yourlogin
     git config --global github.ghe.example.com/api/v3.user yourlogin
     git config --global github.ghe.example.com/api/graphql.user yourlogin

   To also review pull requests on github.com, keep those projects under
one directory and reset the hosts there in ‘.dir-locals.el’:

     ((nil . ((code-review-github-base-url . "github.com")
              (code-review-github-graphql-host . "api.github.com")
              (code-review-github-host . "api.github.com"))))


