16 Troubleshooting
******************

When opening a review fails, you see ‘Got an error from your VC
provider’ and the error is appended to ‘code-review-log-file’, by
default ‘code-review-error.log’ in ‘user-emacs-directory’.  Set
‘code-review-log-raw-request-responses’ to ‘t’ to also log the raw
responses of the forge, which shows what it sent.

‘Cannot determine username’
     Your username on that instance is not in Git; *note Gitlab
     Instances::, or *note Github Enterprise::.

‘Required Gitlab token’ or ‘Required Github token’
     No token was found in your auth source; *note Gitlab
     Authentication::, or *note Github Authentication::.

‘Your PR might have diffs too large’
     Magit could not parse the diff of the pull request.


